<</Title(1. Validate the selected month using datetime.strptime\(month, '%Y-%m'\). 2. Filter expense rows using the date prefix. 3. Sum the amount field to calculate monthly expenditure. 4. Aggregate each amount into a dictionary keyed by category. 5. Calculate each category's share as category total divided by grand total, multiplied by 100. 6. Identify the category with the maximum accumulated amount. 7. If a budget exists, calculate utilisation and remaining budget.)/Dest[16 0 R/Fit]/Parent 889 0 R>>
endobj

